From a65d417dcbeeee15723a9ec9d652fa6c581bdcf0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quirin <quirin.lippl@lippl.gmbh>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 19:43:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Update ucapi to 0.7, keep legacy entity IDs (v0.4.3)

- ucapi >=0.7.0,<0.8: MediaContentType, DeviceClasses.RECEIVER,
  command(..., *, websocket), simple_commands via constructor
- create_entity_id builds the legacy 'EntityTypes.X' prefix explicitly so
  existing activities keep their entities (StrEnum would render 'media_player')
- own event loop instead of deprecated asyncio.get_event_loop()

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MvA6TM72keW1BhxjAipNEU
